## How accessible {{ project_name }} is

{{ project_name }} aims to meet [WCAG 2.2](https://www.w3.org/TR/WCAG22/) at level AA, the usual
standard for accessible websites.

Its conformance is **not assessed**: nobody has checked {{ project_name }} against every WCAG 2.2
rule yet. {{ author_name }} runs the checks below. No outside expert has tested it.

